    "recommendations": "Ensuring the single access point and extended driveway remain unobstructed at all times could significantly improve emergency responder ingress and egress, particularly given the limited rear access to the main building. Posting clear address identification visible from the street frontage would support rapid navigation, especially along the long approach route. Maintaining the unpaved circulation route in a condition that supports vehicle passage may assist apparatus maneuvering around the structure. Awareness of the retention pond location relative to staging areas would support safe responder movement during low-visibility or nighttime operations, and communicating its position to local emergency services in advance could facilitate more effective pre-incident planning."
